  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Watershed Management for Improved Agro-pastoral Livelihoods in the Sepabala Sub-catchment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: Disbursement data provided is cumulative and covers disbursement made by the project Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To mainstream sustainable rangeland management and restoration into the use of watersheds to combat land degradation, enhance the flow of agro-ecosystem goods and services and improve the livelihoods of agro-pastoral communities in the Sebapala Sub-catchment in the Lower Senqu Basin.</narrative>
  </description>
